<div class="text guide-styles" data-units-dynamic="article" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Balance Druid DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c11">Best in Slot Gear for Balance Druid DPS Pre-Raid</span></h2>Balance druids will need to reach the <i>spell hit cap</i>, meaning hit is our strongest secondary stat while we are lacking <i>spell hit cap</i>. We gain spell hit from gear with Hit Rating and from gear with spirit thanks to our talent <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=33596/balance-of-power">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_balanceofpower.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Balance of Power</span></a>. With the help of reforging, reaching hit cap is manageable in pre-raid gear.<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Intellect - New in Cataclysm is that gear has intellect instead of spellpower. Intellect is our strongest stat, so strong that even below hit cap you would rather gem for intellect than hit, which is opposite of how it has been earlier expansions. Note: Weapons still have spell power, it is almost as strong as intellect but not quite, still stronger than all the other stats.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit Rating - You will want a total of +17% chance to hit with spells. This means you'll want at least 1742 rating which ensures your spells never miss. Hit beyond this point does nothing for us and should be reforged into more useful stats like haste or mastery.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Haste - This is our strongest secondary stat after hit cap. It helps us reach more eclipses which will reset the cooldown of our nature's grace giving us even more haste. It also now affects our dots, making them tick faster and therefore dealing more damage.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Mastery - This is a new secondary stat introduced with Cataclysm. It gives an effect directly related to your current spec. For balance druid it increases the strength of our eclipses. After hit cap it is our strongest secondary in aoe sitautions and second strongest in single target situations.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Critical Strike - This is now our weakest secondary stat, however all of our secondary stats are close in power so it is still worth grabbing.</div></li></ol>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
