<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Balance Druid DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-balance-druid-dps">Head for Balance Druid DPS</h4>It is currently unknown exactly how we obtain the LFR pieces in the new dungeon system, but you will aim for almost same items as BiS just LFR with a few exceptions where we grab a valor item or crafted item. For head we will just grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78791/deep-earth-cover">
<img alt="Deep Earth Cover" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deep Earth Cover</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
