<img alt="Deep Earth Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deep Earth Mantle</span></a> if you use balance pieces in the 4 other tier slots.<br/>
<br/>
