<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-balance-druid-dps">Trinkets for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77975/will-of-unbinding">
<img alt="Will of Unbinding" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will of Unbinding</span></a> is our best trinket, and even after entering raids the only trinket you will replace it with is stronger versions of itself.<br/>
<br/>For the remaining trinket slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69110/variable-pulse-lightning-capacitor">
<img alt="Variable Pulse Lightning Capacitor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trinket_naxxramas06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Variable Pulse Lightning Capacitor</span></a> is the best, followed by <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77971/insignia-of-the-corrupted-mind">
<img alt="Insignia of the Corrupted Mind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bijou_purple.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insignia of the Corrupted Mind</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>For solar camping we will want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65105/theralions-mirror">
<img alt="Theralion's Mirror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_teleportironforge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Theralion's Mirror</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70142/moonwell-chalice">
