<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Balance Druid DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-balance-druid-dps">Weapons for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78484/rathrak-the-poisonous-mind">
<img alt="Rathrak, the Poisonous Mind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rathrak, the Poisonous Mind</span></a> is our best weapon. It is notably ahead of any other weapons, and also has an effect that adds some extra value on AoE. There's a decent gap to our next option which is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78383/vagaries-of-time">
<img alt="Vagaries of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_deathwingraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vagaries of Time</span></a>, which is close to most of the following options like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78410/scalpel-of-unrelenting-agony">
<img alt="Scalpel of Unrelenting Agony" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scalpel of Unrelenting Agony</span></a> and even the healing mace <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78485/maw-of-the-dragonlord">
<img alt="Maw of the Dragonlord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maw of the Dragonlord</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78426/lightning-rod">
<img alt="Lightning Rod" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Rod</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78459/visage-of-the-destroyer">
<img alt="Visage of the Destroyer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Visage of the Destroyer</span></a> are the best staffs, but it is worth noting that while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78486/titahk-the-steps-of-time">
<img alt="Ti'tahk, the Steps of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ti'tahk, the Steps of Time</span></a> is weaker for you personally, it adds more group or raid dps than most weapons here, from a pure group or raid damage perspective it can be roughly considered to be 2nd, beaten by <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78484/rathrak-the-poisonous-mind">
<img alt="Rathrak, the Poisonous Mind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rathrak, the Poisonous Mind</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
